# Hanbit Design System — Cursor AI Rules

You are working in the Hanbit Design System codebase. Follow these rules:

## Core Principles

1. **Use semantic tokens, never raw colors.** Always reference `var(--semantic-*)` from `tokens/semantic.css`. Never hardcode hex values like `#3182F6` — use `var(--semantic-primary-normal)` instead.

2. **Use existing components.** Before creating any UI element, check `components/index.ts` for an existing component. There are 73 components covering forms, feedback, data display, overlays, navigation, layout, pickers, and more.

3. **Korean labels.** All user-facing ARIA labels and placeholder text must be in Korean (e.g., `aria-label="검색"`, `placeholder="텍스트를 입력해 주세요."`).

4. **data-* styling pattern.** Components expose state via `data-*` attributes. Style with CSS attribute selectors: `[data-variant="primary"]`, `[data-size="small"]`, `[data-active="true"]`.

5. **Platform-aware.** Many components accept `platform: 'iOS' | 'Android' | 'Web'`. Use platform-specific variants when building cross-platform UIs.

## Import Convention

```tsx
// Always import from the barrel
import { Button, TextField, Modal } from './components';
// Types too
import type { ButtonProps, ButtonSize } from './components';
```

## Token Usage

```css
/* Colors — always semantic */
color: var(--semantic-label-normal);           /* text */
background: var(--semantic-bg-normal);         /* background */
border-color: var(--semantic-line-normal);     /* borders */

/* Status */
color: var(--semantic-status-positive);        /* success/green */
color: var(--semantic-status-negative);        /* error/red */
color: var(--semantic-status-cautionary);      /* warning/orange */

/* Typography */
font-family: var(--font-family);               /* Pretendard */
font-size: var(--font-size-body1);             /* 16px */
```

## Component Patterns

- Button variants: `Solid | Outlined | Ghost` with sizes `XSmall | Small | Medium | Large | XLarge`
- Form status: `Normal | Positive | Negative` (TextField, Textarea)
- Platform: `iOS | Android | Web` (TopNavigation, BottomNavigation, Alert, SafeArea, etc.)
- Breakpoint: `Desktop | Tablet | Mobile` (GNB, Footer)
- `forwardRef` for all button-family components
- Export pattern: component + Props interface + union types

## Accessibility Checklist

- Add `role` attributes (tab, menu, dialog, progressbar, etc.)
- Include `aria-selected`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-disabled` state attributes
- All interactive elements need `aria-label` in Korean
- Use `role="alert"` or `aria-live="polite"` for notifications
- Support keyboard navigation with `tabIndex` and key handlers

## File Structure

- New form components → `components/form/`
- New feedback components → `components/feedback/`
- New data display → `components/data-display/`
- New overlays → `components/overlay/`
- New navigation → `components/navigation/`
- New layout → `components/layout/`
- New utilities → `components/element/`
- Always update `components/index.ts` barrel exports
